<title>USA: Seattle FilmWorks may repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Seattle FilmWorks may repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE, Wash. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle FilmWorks Inc said it may repurchase shares of its common stock, either through open market purchase at prevailing market prices, through block purchases, or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The repurchase may be commenced or discontinued at any time.</p>
</text>
